<REAPER_PROJECT 0.1 "7.77/macOS-arm64" 1784286754 0
  <NOTES 0 2
    |H10 AMBIENT PRESET TEMPLATE
    |Date: 2026-07-15
    |Project: H10 Ambient Preset Template.RPP
    |
    |STATIC PALETTE
    |1 WARM PAD: Warmbo | Third Party/Databroth/Pads | Databroth
    |   Dark-warm, restrained mid bed. Existing Surge preset state from the audition shortlist; shared buses retained.
    |2 SOFT FELT: Piano Remains 1 | Plucks | Claes
    |   Gentle piano/pluck detail. Slow stock MIDI Arpeggiator before Surge; factory send delay bypassed.
    |3 AIR TEXTURE: Air Spray | Third Party/Inigo Kennedy/FX | Inigo Kennedy
    |   Stable high-air veil. Factory send delay and reverb bypassed.
    |
    |SHARED EFFECTS
    |4 SHARED REVERB: Volume Adjustment -> dark 100% wet ReaVerbate
    |5 DARK DELAY: 100% wet ReaDelay -> Stereo Width
    |
    |H10 MACROS (MIDI channel 1, bus 1)
    |1 BRIGHTNESS <- CC11 regulation -> Warmbo filter cutoff, normalized 0.66 to 0.72
    |2 EVENT DENSITY <- CC12 motion -> arpeggiator rate, narrowed for lower repetition
    |3 MODULATION DEPTH <- CC15 fluidity -> Air Spray LFO 1 amplitude, narrowed for subtler air motion
    |4 REVERB SEND <- CC17 stillness -> shared reverb input, narrowed and darker/cleaner
    |5 STEREO MOVEMENT <- CC16 rotation -> dark delay width, narrowed for subtle motion
    |
    |GUARDRAILS
    |- CC10 arousal is intentionally unassigned.
    |- Heartbeat note 36 is intentionally unassigned.
    |- No heart-rate mapping to bass, loudness, dissonance, impacts, or cinematic tension.
    |- No automation envelopes and no custom JSFX instruments.
    |- Only tracks 1-3 generate sound; tracks 4-5 are shared effect returns.
    |- Source MIDI is a 64-second loop at 72 BPM for static audition and live H10 control.
